 "Use the Imperative to give instructions.<br><br>  The Imperative only has one form. You do not use a subject.<br><br>  We often use the Imperative in ads to showcase a product and attract customers."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Sail with us to the Belize Barrier Reef!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Embark on an adventure!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Come and experience a once-in-a-lifetime journey! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Snorkel through coral reefs off the coast of Belize City. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Hop on board one of our glass-bottom boats! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "See why Charles Darwin described it as \"the most remarkable reef in the West Indies\" in 1842."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coral "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "shell formations found in tropical waters "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Belize is home to a great variety of coral."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in an ad about Belize!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "reef "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a ridge of sand or coral just below the surface of the sea "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Belize Barrier Reef is a popular tourist destination."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vital "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "essential; necessary"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The fishing industry is vital to the economy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "diverse "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "varied"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Reef is one of the most diverse ecosystems in the world."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "diversity"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "variety "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The reef is home to a large diversity of plants and animals."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "industry "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "economic activity; production"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The reef is vital to the country's fishing industry."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "vulnerable "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to be hurt; in danger"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The reef was designated a World Heritage Site because of its vulnerable wildlife."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "yacht "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large luxury boat"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sail through the coral reef on our yacht!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "all-inclusive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "all services are included in the price"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Enjoy an unforgettable cruise! Prices are all-inclusive."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le09ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a product you like, or a great tourist destination."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go online and find ads about them."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Watch or read the ads. Pay attention to the expressions they use."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write an ad about the product (5-8 lines)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your ad to your class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write 5-8 lines describing a product I like or a great tourist destination."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use exciting language with instructions to talk about the product or tourist destination."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what people/things do or did in the description."}]}], "type": "sena"}